name: The Tribe — flush X2
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Tribe gives X2 Mult if the played hand contains a Flush. First-shop X2 engine:
  Smeared Joker halves the suit requirement; Droll Joker and Crafty Joker add base mult/chips.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: TheTribe
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: DrollJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: CraftyJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
